==Battleground==
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 5~8.33 seconds<sup>150f~250f</sup>.
*1 [[Sakura (Enemy)|Sakura]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Send out [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] as soon as the first Pigeon de Sable spawns for extra cash, then start spamming [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]] until Bullet Train kills the second Sable. Once you have enough money, spawn in [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to take down the base as quickly as possible. Just equip the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] to KB the Chickful A and victory is yours.

